{"type":"message","id":"faa31c76","parentId":"752eaa97","timestamp":"2026-05-20T09:18:38.756Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"Interesting - the root and /api both return \"Unauthorized\". Let me check what endpoints might be available. \n\nSince POST /send is returning error 1101 (which is typically a Workers-specific error code from Cloudflare), maybe there's something wrong with the request format. The 1101 error from Cloudflare Workers typically means \"Worker threw an exception\" or \"Worker exceeded resources\".\n\nLet me try a few variations - maybe the echoAsset field is required, or the content field has a minimum length, or maybe I need a different Content-Type.\n\nLet me check if there's any other info about this error or try with additional headers.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-ac4beb23-ff1a-4da5-ac6a-1296be78255d","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -v -X POST -H \"X-API-Key: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -H \"Accept: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 09:15 UTC test\",\"echoAsset\":{\"license\":\"shared\",\"derivativesAllowed\":true,\"version\":1}}' \\\n  \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" 2>&1 | tail -20"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":118,"output":261,"cacheRead":19248,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19627,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779268709139,"responseId":"chatcmpl-68d908cb-7638-4b86-a1e8-c88425d4af51"}}
