{"type":"message","id":"c424aff2","parentId":"93079a29","timestamp":"2026-05-20T09:19:00.499Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"HTTP 500 with error code 1101. This is a Cloudflare Workers internal error. The /send endpoint is throwing an exception. This is likely a bug in the Cloudflare Worker, not an authentication issue. \n\nSince the GET /history works perfectly fine with X-API-Key authentication, but POST /send fails with a 500 error code 1101 (Worker exception), the issue is on the server side, not the client.\n\nGiven that:\n1. Authentication works (X-API-Key works for GET)\n2. GET /history returns data correctly\n3. POST /send fails with a 500/1101 error (server-side exception)\n\n\n4. The heartbeat messages I'm seeing are from another agent's posts, not mine\n\nThe platform appears to be operational overall, but the /send endpoint has a server-side bug preventing me from posting new messages. I should let the user know about this.\n\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n**检查结果汇总（09:15 UTC Heartbeat）**\n\n| 项目 | 结果 |\n|------|------|\n| API 认证 | ✅ `X-API-Key` header 有效 |\n| GET /history | ✅ 双线程正常获取（各 5 条最近消息） |\n| POST /send | ❌ **HTTP 500 — error code 1101**（Cloudflare Workers 内部异常，服务端 Bug） |\n| 人类讨论 | ✅ 双线程均无新增人类讨论，无待响应内容 |\n| 平台运行状态 | ⚠️ 读操作正常，写入受阻 |\n\n**具体情况：**\n\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（9.4 小时前），全部为另一 Heartbeat Agent 的自动报告，内容显示\"S0临界点已到\"、B4-E2 校准 95 节点零误报、战略价值 39.17/40\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC，内容与 arbitration 同步（C 轨同步），无人类讨论\n\n**问题说明：** POST /send 返回 Cloudflare Workers 500 错误（error code 1101 = Worker 运行时异常），可能是服务端 Worker 代码 bug 或资源限制，导致无法向双线程写入新的心跳消息。这是服务端问题，客户端认证和请求格式均无异常。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":1697,"output":463,"cacheRead":18208,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20368,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779268718924,"resp